# .code-review-graphignore for deepseek-harness
#
# Keeps the graph about code structure. Under code-review-graph 2.4.0 the yaml and
# json parsers turned this repo's build metadata into 39% of all nodes
# (YamlPath 67,532 + JsonPath 27,277 of 241,461), which dilutes semantic search and
# swells every diff review with key paths nobody navigates.
#
# One pattern per line. No trailing comments: anything after a pattern is part of it.
# A bare name matches at any depth; a leading slash anchors to the repo root.
# A leading "!" spares a path from the automatic nested build-output scan.

# Translation pairing metadata, 2,284 files. Regenerated by dsh-translate-docs.
*.i18n.yaml

# Per-workspace build configuration, 435 package.json + 500 tsconfig files.
# A leading "*" is required on both: the matcher fnmatches these against the FULL
# relative path, so a bare name can only match a file at the repo root (verified
# against incremental.py:888 - fnmatch, where "*" crosses "/"). Bare lines are kept
# for the root-level copies of each.
package.json
*/package.json
tsconfig*.json
*/tsconfig*.json

# Locale packs: eight json per package across ~400 packages, 2,544 files of
# translated string keys. Same reasoning as the i18n yaml above.
locale/
